== Overview ==
The '''Welder Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] added in the [[Episode 68 Part 2 Update]]. It has a special ability to weld toilets together to make them more powerful. 

==Appearance==
The Welder Toilet wears a welding mask and has a claw on its left hand and metal type on its right. It wears a jetpack on its back. The claw it uses is nearly identical in model as the claw from the [[Forklift Toilet]], only differences being the color and size.

==Waves==
''80: 6x Welder Toilets (Unconfirmed)''

==Strategy==
'''Welder Toilet''' is not very deadly, but anything that it picks up can be deadly sometimes since it may be a stunning type and when released, the units might be in a situational attack if it happens. The enemy itself or whatever it holds has to be defeated to slow down the stuns by using high Dps units.

==Trivia== 

*Welder Toilet, along with [[Forklift Toilet]] are the only toilets that can pick up other toilets.
*Welder Toilets can sometimes pick [[enemies]] that can stun [[units]] making the toilets unable to stun the [[units]], so it can actually help the player in certain occasions.
*If there is a row of them, they have a chance where they can weld themselves together forming a chain.
